sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant W as Host screen (web)
    participant S as Game server
    participant P as Player phones (iOS)
    participant DB as MongoDB

    Note over W,DB: Create room (verified host only)
    W->>S: POST /rooms preset
    S->>DB: check host emailVerified
    S-->>W: room code
    W->>S: connect to room as host
    S->>W: room:state players, preset
    Note over W: shows code + join QR

    Note over S,P: Join (the QR opens the app with the code filled in)
    P->>S: GET /rooms/:code
    S-->>P: open, started, full, or not found
    P->>S: room:join code, displayName
    alt name taken, room full, or game started
        S->>P: error code, message
    else seat open
        S-->>P: seat + rejoinToken
        S->>W: room:state players
    end

    opt Host kicks a player before Start
        W->>S: room:kick seatId
        S->>P: error kicked
        S->>W: room:state players
    end

    Note over W,P: Start (4 to 8 players)
    W->>S: room:start
    Note over S: deal costumes, pick Monster + type, lock the code
    S->>P: you:role role, costume (monsterType to the Monster only)
    S->>W: room:state playing
    S->>W: phase:start night (see One round)

    Note over S,P: A phone drops and comes back
    P->>S: room:join code, rejoinToken (or signed-in account)
    S->>P: you:rejoined full private state
    S->>W: room:state player connected
    Note over S,P: gone 2 full rounds: removed as if killed, Monster gone means Villagers win

    Note over W,S: The host screen drops
    S->>P: room:state host disconnected, timers paused
    W->>S: reopen room as host
    S->>W: room:state, timers resume
